        "description" : "<p>\n      Defines the acquisition order of unstitched image tiles. <code data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"538\">Raster</code> \n      indicates that all rows are acquired in the same direction, whereas <code data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"619\">Serpentine</code> \n      indicates alternating acquisition directions between successive rows.\n    </p>"
