      "9aa083d4-45a5-4a3c-9bc1-abc9c65f5e83/code" : {
        "name" : "Code",
        "description" : "The macro code. Images are opened as windows named according to the input slot. You have to select windows with the select() function or comparable functions. You have have one results table input which can be addressed via the global functions. Input ROI are merged into one ROI manager.\n\nYou can define variables that are passed from JIPipe to ImageJ. Variables are also created for incoming path-like data, named according to the slot name. Annotations can also be accessed via a function getJIPipeAnnotation(key) or getJIPipeTextAnnotation(key), which returns the string value of the annotation or an empty string if no value was set."
      },
      "8756f105-1e75-4d2a-bdef-6c0020abd3b6/jipipe:parameter-slot-algorithm/parameter-annotations-use-internal-names" : {
